'll, we'll. Phủ định: will not = won't.\nQuá khứ bất quy tắc phải học thuộc: go → went, see → saw, eat → ate, buy → bought, forget → forgot.\n\"Maybe\" (có lẽ) đứng đầu câu: \"Maybe it will rain tomorrow.\"\nRủ rê: \"Let's ...\" (Chúng ta hãy ... nhé): \"Let's have a picnic.\"","lessonId":"u16n5l5","lessonVersion":"v2.u16n5l5","manifestHash":"013672aa5927648264926e14d514d9d670ba04f547fc10aba6d50095b8e8b587","nodeId":"u16n5","order":124,"rewardIdentity":"v2.u16n5l5","schemaVersion":1,"sectionId":"sec2","signature":"ByEDTwawcBDcPitMUfqW5VLL08XeARWCJaX15Bt66hQniVGcQXMdiMrND6VPaych8z9LFzlo0MXUeNwljkNICg","signatureKeyId":"dev-content-1","skillIds":["u16.vocab","u16.grammar","listening"],"title":"Sẵn sàng chưa? · Bài 5","unitId":"u16"}